  "physical_definition": "Allow only the three parent shared storm/rain coefficients and westerly_speed to differ from the environmental control. Preserve environmental6K/km, independent water, corrected rain/recycling and every other actual parameter. Wind is background peak amplitude, not measured column speed; all coupled fields respond. Same hard invariant and reference checks, identical soft prediction objective and shortlist criteria.",
