  "screen": "Newpolicy: assess hard physical/structural eligibility separately from observational skill. Noindividualregion, nativehumidity orSST prediction-errorveto duringoptimization. Penalize average andregional/native/oceanregret explicitly; report every raw error and original strict-gate violation ascontext in publication. Missing/nonfinite scores, unpairedcases/footprints and changedfixedparameters failclosed. No alteration ofoldcampaignresults.",
